  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国此生必看的十大壮丽奇观岭，最震撼的是哪一个吗？上集，咱们聊了黄山、鸣沙山月牙泉、黄果树瀑布、张家界、武陵源、秦始皇陵兵马俑。有人在评论区说，兵马俑鞋底的针脚听得人心，头一震，可我跟您说，兵马俑排第六后头，这五个才真正叫改写认知榜首，那个地方全是世界都听过，可绝大多数人不知道他的真实模样有多震撼。老规矩开讲前，劳烦各位老友顺手点亮红心。评论区打的来了，咱们直接揭开前五名第五名，都江堰、四川成都。这是整张榜单里最不像奇观的一处，它长得太素了，就是一条江一堆石头，一条高低，可他是唯一一处，还在替咱们干活的老古董。两千两百多年前，李兵到这儿，当蜀郡守，面对的是一条年年发大水的岷江。别人治水是修大坝，赌李兵不堵，他在江中间拿竹笼装上鹅卵石，垒出一条分水的鱼嘴，把江一劈两半。冬天，水少六成，水自动拐进内江去灌成都平原的庄稼。夏天水大多余的水，自己翻出去从外疆抬走，不费一度电不烧一顿煤，没有任何高科技。两千两百年来，每天都在自动运转，硬生生把一个水旱灾害不断的地方浇灌，成了天下文明的天府之国粮仓。您站在鱼嘴上往下看，水就在那儿分分了两千两百年，一天没停过。前面兵马俑是两千两百年前做的，早就不用了。都江堰是两千两百年前建的，今天还在烧饭，还在灌地，这不是古迹，这是还在上班的。祖宗手艺。第四名，衡山悬空寺，山西浑源这一处是拿胆子看的，他不是盖在山上，是钉在山上。整座寺庙挂在金龙峡的绝壁上，离谷底几十米，四十来间房就这么贴着直上直下的岩壁排开。从下面往上看，像是从石头缝里长出来的一排燕子窝。您顺着窄梯子上去，脚底下踩的是木板，一踩，咯吱一响，扶着栏杆往下探头，下面就一道缝。风从窄，口口灌进来，整座楼跟着耳朵一起晃，他凭什么挂得住古人？每往石头上钉一根钉，而是在岩壁上凿出暗孔，把穆衡梁一头深深插进山体插进去的那一段，占了整根梁的三分之二，另一头挑出来承重，上面再搭楼粮是好粮，一千五百年不烂。这一千五百年里，这一带地震闹过多少回，山洪冲过多少回，他照样扎在那儿，一片瓦都没掉下来。四十间房靠几十根插进石头里的木头占了十五个世纪。这不仅是胆量，这是中国古代木构建筑留在绝壁上的奇迹。第三名，四川阿坝的九寨沟九寨归来不看水，这话不是吹的，他的水干净到让人没话说。您站在湖边往下看，能看到水底几百年倒下去的老树横在湖底早就死了，可他没烂。水里的碳酸钙一层一层裹上去，把黑木头裹成了，白的像一根根搁在水底的白玉。再往边上看，水浅的地方是碧绿，往前走几步变成孔雀蓝。太阳转到头顶，又成了深蓝，同一片湖，一上午换好几回，脸色，可不管什么颜色，底下都看得清清楚楚，九寨沟也不是没遭过难。二零一七年，那场地震，山体震塌了一段盖华瀑布震断的很多人说这地方完了，结果呢水自己回来了。几年时间，那些断了的地方又慢慢长出新的盖，花一层一层往回铺瀑布，重新留成了白色。这就是九寨沟最厉害的地方，它不是一幅挂在那儿不动的画，他是活的有自愈的能力，看一眼就让人心里通透宽敞。第二名，甘肃敦煌的莫高窟，他排第二，不是因为它有多好看，而是因为这是一处正在以肉眼可见的速度一天天离我们而去的文明孤品。鸣沙山东路断崖上开凿的七百多个洞窟，里面保存着四万五千多平米的壁画。四万五千平米是什么概念？铺开来有整整六十多架波音客机，那么大可这些壁画，全是画在脆弱的泥土草料，墙上的大漠的风沙，昼夜的温差，再加上游客进洞呼出的一口口二氧化碳和水汽，壁画，齐甲开裂褪色，每天都在悄悄发生。打着微弱的冷光手电走进去，空气里是干燥的黄土乡手电。光照上去的一刹那，反弹琵琶的飞天衣带飘飘，色泽斑斓，可讲解袁惠轻声催您走，因为每多待一分钟，温度湿度都在变。今天看得到的几个哭，过两年可能就得永久封存，这地方不是想去就能去，是再不去就真的看不到了。聊到这儿，我想跟你唠几句心里话。评论区不少朋友说，这些地方心里记挂了半辈子，可林道动身又犯了难，怕海拔高，身子骨吃不消是一头，更怕费了半天劲。到了跟前，门道一点看不出来，这话我懂就说莫高窟壁画不摸清背景，在您眼里就是一片颜色。都江堰不知道李兵当年怎么把一条江劈成两半，站在鱼嘴上，也就看个热闹。悬空寺那几根木梁是怎么挂住的？更没人跟您讲，带孙辈出门的孩子，只着问一句，这水怎么自己就分了。您要是答不上来，脸上就挂不住。前阵子有朋友给我推了本书叫大美，中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方，说是把全国一百零一个最值得去的地方，一个一个的攻略来历、门道都理好了，还配的实拍的图，翻着不累，出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，知道该往哪看，暂时去不了的，就着慢慢翻，也算走过一趟书，我搁在左下方商品里感兴趣的老朋友去瞅一眼。好社会正题。第一名，西藏林芝的雅鲁藏布大峡谷和他守着的南迦巴瓦峰，为什么是他？我先问您一句，整张榜单走到这儿，前面那些一个是人用泥捏的，一个是人拿石头垒的，一个是人把木头插进崖壁的，全是人干的活。您以为第一也该是这么一处老古董，可偏偏不是，它是喜马拉雅东边的一条口子，被雅鲁藏布江从世界屋脊上硬生生劈出来，还拐了一个著名的大弯。世界上最深的峡谷最深的地方超过六千米南加，巴瓦峰立在旁边，海拔七千七百八十二米，从谷底到封顶，落差五千多米。什么概念？您从峡谷底往上走，一开始是湿热的原始森林，藤蔓缠在树上，跟西双版纳一个样。再往上是甄叶林，再往上是高山草甸，走到最后，是终年不化的血和冰一根柱子上四个世界，可这条裂缝平时是不给您看的。南家爸爸一年里大半时间裹在云雾里，当地人管他叫修女峰说，能看见封顶的人是攒的福气。很多人守好几天，连一块石头都没看着，就下山了。前面九处有的是老天爷给咱们造的奇观，有的是老祖宗给咱们留的手艺，只有这一处是老天爷再量自己的尺寸。把冰和火把、雪山和雨林全塞进一条五千米深的口子里。看完它，您才知道前面那九个太单薄，太渺小，十个地方说完了，您回头细品品。黄山是水墨画，月牙泉是大漠清泉月果树是水声，如雷，张家界是大地骨骼。张马俑是泥土清浑都江堰，这道法自然，悬空，似是绝壁奇迹。九寨沟是活水生命，莫高窟是一面正在褪色的墙。雅鲁藏布大峡谷与南加巴瓦峰是看一眼就让人闭上嘴巴的终极尺度。这十处壮丽奇观，趁要紧的是，他们都不等人。壁画在一寸寸风化雪山，在一年年变样，趁腿脚还利索，趁眼里还有光，别光顾着收藏了。出发前想把门道摸透的那本大美中国的链接。就在左下角觉得这期内容给您提了提气，劳烦转给身边，想一块出门看看的朋友，想听更多中华大地的好故事。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 4050,
      "text": "您知道中国此生必看的十大壮丽奇观岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4430,
      "end_ms": 6330,
      "text": "最震撼的是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6730,
      "end_ms": 7270,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7290,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "咱们聊了黄山、鸣沙山月牙泉、黄果树瀑布、张家界、武陵源、秦始皇陵兵马俑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 16670,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "有人在评论区说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18390,
      "end_ms": 20730,
      "text": "兵马俑鞋底的针脚听得人心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20730,
      "end_ms": 21390,
      "text": "头一震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21810,
      "end_ms": 22650,
      "text": "可我跟您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22950,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "兵马俑排第六后头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25350,
      "end_ms": 28370,
      "text": "这五个才真正叫改写认知榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28470,
      "end_ms": 31000,
      "text": "那个地方全是世界都听过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31360,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "text": "可绝大多数人不知道他的真实模样有多震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36340,
      "end_ms": 38480,
      "text": "老规矩开讲前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38920,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "劳烦各位老友顺手点亮红心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42280,
      "end_ms": 44000,
      "text": "评论区打的来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44640,
      "end_ms": 47880,
      "text": "咱们直接揭开前五名第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48200,
      "end_ms": 50220,
      "text": "都江堰、四川成都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50760,
      "end_ms": 54280,
      "text": "这是整张榜单里最不像奇观的一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54920,
      "end_ms": 56320,
      "text": "它长得太素了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56720,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "text": "就是一条江一堆石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59600,
      "end_ms": 60405,
      "text": "一条高低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 60900,
      "end_ms": 62440,
      "text": "可他是唯一一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62480,
      "end_ms": 64644,
      "text": "还在替咱们干活的老古董。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 65350,
      "end_ms": 67095,
      "text": "两千两百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 67560,
      "end_ms": 68400,
      "text": "李兵到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 68400,
      "end_ms": 69325,
      "text": "当蜀郡守，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69860,
      "end_ms": 73305,
      "text": "面对的是一条年年发大水的岷江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74030,
      "end_ms": 75845,
      "text": "别人治水是修大坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76120,
      "end_ms": 77415,
      "text": "赌李兵不堵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77780,
      "end_ms": 80765,
      "text": "他在江中间拿竹笼装上鹅卵石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81320,
      "end_ms": 83575,
      "text": "垒出一条分水的鱼嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84250,
      "end_ms": 85825,
      "text": "把江一劈两半。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 86230,
      "end_ms": 86670,
      "text": "冬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 86730,
      "end_ms": 88310,
      "text": "水少六成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 88310,
      "end_ms": 92635,
      "text": "水自动拐进内江去灌成都平原的庄稼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93230,
      "end_ms": 95520,
      "text": "夏天水大多余的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95560,
      "end_ms": 98675,
      "text": "自己翻出去从外疆抬走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 99060,
      "end_ms": 101620,
      "text": "不费一度电不烧一顿煤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 102000,
      "end_ms": 103555,
      "text": "没有任何高科技。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104180,
      "end_ms": 105540,
      "text": "两千两百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105620,
      "end_ms": 107565,
      "text": "每天都在自动运转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 108070,
      "end_ms": 112290,
      "text": "硬生生把一个水旱灾害不断的地方浇灌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 112290,
      "end_ms": 115525,
      "text": "成了天下文明的天府之国粮仓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 115920,
      "end_ms": 117905,
      "text": "您站在鱼嘴上往下看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 118400,
      "end_ms": 122260,
      "text": "水就在那儿分分了两千两百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 122760,
      "end_ms": 124180,
      "text": "一天没停过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 124620,
      "end_ms": 127420,
      "text": "前面兵马俑是两千两百年前做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 128040,
      "end_ms": 129080,
      "text": "早就不用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 129560,
      "end_ms": 131960,
      "text": "都江堰是两千两百年前建的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 132400,
      "end_ms": 133760,
      "text": "今天还在烧饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 134300,
      "end_ms": 135240,
      "text": "还在灌地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 135820,
      "end_ms": 136920,
      "text": "这不是古迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 137540,
      "end_ms": 138920,
      "text": "这是还在上班的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 138920,
      "end_ms": 139800,
      "text": "祖宗手艺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 140200,
      "end_ms": 140940,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 141420,
      "end_ms": 142900,
      "text": "衡山悬空寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 143560,
      "end_ms": 147940,
      "text": "山西浑源这一处是拿胆子看的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 148160,
      "end_ms": 149280,
      "text": "他不是盖在山上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 149280,
      "end_ms": 151090,
      "text": "是钉在山上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 151450,
      "end_ms": 154550,
      "text": "整座寺庙挂在金龙峡的绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 155110,
      "end_ms": 156530,
      "text": "离谷底几十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 157030,
      "end_ms": 161250,
      "text": "四十来间房就这么贴着直上直下的岩壁排开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 161970,
      "end_ms": 163470,
      "text": "从下面往上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 163990,
      "end_ms": 167830,
      "text": "像是从石头缝里长出来的一排燕子窝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 168250,
      "end_ms": 170170,
      "text": "您顺着窄梯子上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 170790,
      "end_ms": 172370,
      "text": "脚底下踩的是木板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 172730,
      "end_ms": 173210,
      "text": "一踩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 173330,
      "end_ms": 174170,
      "text": "咯吱一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 174830,
      "end_ms": 176390,
      "text": "扶着栏杆往下探头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 176390,
      "end_ms": 178310,
      "text": "下面就一道缝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 178310,
      "end_ms": 179630,
      "text": "风从窄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 179730,
      "end_ms": 180985,
      "text": "口口灌进来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181410,
      "end_ms": 183355,
      "text": "整座楼跟着耳朵一起晃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 183900,
      "end_ms": 186200,
      "text": "他凭什么挂得住古人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 186220,
      "end_ms": 187995,
      "text": "每往石头上钉一根钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 188770,
      "end_ms": 191345,
      "text": "而是在岩壁上凿出暗孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 192160,
      "end_ms": 197090,
      "text": "把穆衡梁一头深深插进山体插进去的那一段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 197130,
      "end_ms": 199205,
      "text": "占了整根梁的三分之二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 199810,
      "end_ms": 201445,
      "text": "另一头挑出来承重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 202150,
      "end_ms": 204835,
      "text": "上面再搭楼粮是好粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 205300,
      "end_ms": 206805,
      "text": "一千五百年不烂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 207180,
      "end_ms": 208545,
      "text": "这一千五百年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 208820,
      "end_ms": 210440,
      "text": "这一带地震闹过多少回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 210720,
      "end_ms": 212095,
      "text": "山洪冲过多少回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212380,
      "end_ms": 213735,
      "text": "他照样扎在那儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 214040,
      "end_ms": 215485,
      "text": "一片瓦都没掉下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 215930,
      "end_ms": 221525,
      "text": "四十间房靠几十根插进石头里的木头占了十五个世纪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 222240,
      "end_ms": 223765,
      "text": "这不仅是胆量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 224330,
      "end_ms": 228685,
      "text": "这是中国古代木构建筑留在绝壁上的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229070,
      "end_ms": 229825,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 230360,
      "end_ms": 234305,
      "text": "四川阿坝的九寨沟九寨归来不看水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 234680,
      "end_ms": 235845,
      "text": "这话不是吹的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 236320,
      "end_ms": 239005,
      "text": "他的水干净到让人没话说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 239450,
      "end_ms": 241165,
      "text": "您站在湖边往下看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 241500,
      "end_ms": 247435,
      "text": "能看到水底几百年倒下去的老树横在湖底早就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 247880,
      "end_ms": 248705,
      "text": "可他没烂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 249340,
      "end_ms": 252065,
      "text": "水里的碳酸钙一层一层裹上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 252430,
      "end_ms": 253790,
      "text": "把黑木头裹成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 253790,
      "end_ms": 257155,
      "text": "白的像一根根搁在水底的白玉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 257550,
      "end_ms": 258555,
      "text": "再往边上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 258940,
      "end_ms": 260875,
      "text": "水浅的地方是碧绿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 261700,
      "end_ms": 264355,
      "text": "往前走几步变成孔雀蓝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 265110,
      "end_ms": 266410,
      "text": "太阳转到头顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 266550,
      "end_ms": 267745,
      "text": "又成了深蓝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 268200,
      "end_ms": 269175,
      "text": "同一片湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 270090,
      "end_ms": 271710,
      "text": "一上午换好几回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 271710,
      "end_ms": 272315,
      "text": "脸色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 272920,
      "end_ms": 274400,
      "text": "可不管什么颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 274620,
      "end_ms": 276545,
      "text": "底下都看得清清楚楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 276970,
      "end_ms": 278545,
      "text": "九寨沟也不是没遭过难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 279470,
      "end_ms": 280370,
      "text": "二零一七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 280370,
      "end_ms": 281135,
      "text": "那场地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 281790,
      "end_ms": 287375,
      "text": "山体震塌了一段盖华瀑布震断的很多人说这地方完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287900,
      "end_ms": 290055,
      "text": "结果呢水自己回来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 290510,
      "end_ms": 291490,
      "text": "几年时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 291890,
      "end_ms": 295550,
      "text": "那些断了的地方又慢慢长出新的盖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 295550,
      "end_ms": 299190,
      "text": "花一层一层往回铺瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 299310,
      "end_ms": 301050,
      "text": "重新留成了白色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 301530,
      "end_ms": 303390,
      "text": "这就是九寨沟最厉害的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 303870,
      "end_ms": 306609,
      "text": "它不是一幅挂在那儿不动的画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 307190,
      "end_ms": 310510,
      "text": "他是活的有自愈的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 311070,
      "end_ms": 314090,
      "text": "看一眼就让人心里通透宽敞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 314450,
      "end_ms": 315050,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 315410,
      "end_ms": 317030,
      "text": "甘肃敦煌的莫高窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 317370,
      "end_ms": 318170,
      "text": "他排第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 318710,
      "end_ms": 320205,
      "text": "不是因为它有多好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 320840,
      "end_ms": 328200,
      "text": "而是因为这是一处正在以肉眼可见的速度一天天离我们而去的文明孤品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 328660,
      "end_ms": 332140,
      "text": "鸣沙山东路断崖上开凿的七百多个洞窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 332700,
      "end_ms": 335900,
      "text": "里面保存着四万五千多平米的壁画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 336540,
      "end_ms": 338540,
      "text": "四万五千平米是什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 339120,
      "end_ms": 342540,
      "text": "铺开来有整整六十多架波音客机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 342540,
      "end_ms": 344460,
      "text": "那么大可这些壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 344540,
      "end_ms": 347400,
      "text": "全是画在脆弱的泥土草料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 347420,
      "end_ms": 350005,
      "text": "墙上的大漠的风沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 350470,
      "end_ms": 351715,
      "text": "昼夜的温差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 352140,
      "end_ms": 356875,
      "text": "再加上游客进洞呼出的一口口二氧化碳和水汽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 357410,
      "end_ms": 357890,
      "text": "壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 357970,
      "end_ms": 360300,
      "text": "齐甲开裂褪色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 360480,
      "end_ms": 362385,
      "text": "每天都在悄悄发生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00140",
      "start_ms": 362860,
      "end_ms": 365495,
      "text": "打着微弱的冷光手电走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00141",
      "start_ms": 365860,
      "end_ms": 369130,
      "text": "空气里是干燥的黄土乡手电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00142",
      "start_ms": 369190,
      "end_ms": 371015,
      "text": "光照上去的一刹那，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00143",
      "start_ms": 371370,
      "end_ms": 374310,
      "text": "反弹琵琶的飞天衣带飘飘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00144",
      "start_ms": 374710,
      "end_ms": 375845,
      "text": "色泽斑斓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00145",
      "start_ms": 376240,
      "end_ms": 378815,
      "text": "可讲解袁惠轻声催您走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00146",
      "start_ms": 379450,
      "end_ms": 381365,
      "text": "因为每多待一分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00147",
      "start_ms": 381850,
      "end_ms": 384025,
      "text": "温度湿度都在变。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00148",
      "start_ms": 384820,
      "end_ms": 386885,
      "text": "今天看得到的几个哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00149",
      "start_ms": 387400,
      "end_ms": 390085,
      "text": "过两年可能就得永久封存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00150",
      "start_ms": 390520,
      "end_ms": 392485,
      "text": "这地方不是想去就能去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00151",
      "start_ms": 392940,
      "end_ms": 395465,
      "text": "是再不去就真的看不到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00152",
      "start_ms": 395860,
      "end_ms": 396675,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00153",
      "start_ms": 396860,
      "end_ms": 398545,
      "text": "我想跟你唠几句心里话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00154",
      "start_ms": 398920,
      "end_ms": 400455,
      "text": "评论区不少朋友说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00155",
      "start_ms": 400970,
      "end_ms": 403505,
      "text": "这些地方心里记挂了半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00156",
      "start_ms": 404030,
      "end_ms": 406235,
      "text": "可林道动身又犯了难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00157",
      "start_ms": 406850,
      "end_ms": 407830,
      "text": "怕海拔高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00158",
      "start_ms": 408130,
      "end_ms": 410185,
      "text": "身子骨吃不消是一头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00159",
      "start_ms": 410810,
      "end_ms": 412250,
      "text": "更怕费了半天劲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00160",
      "start_ms": 412330,
      "end_ms": 413185,
      "text": "到了跟前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00161",
      "start_ms": 413650,
      "end_ms": 415555,
      "text": "门道一点看不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00162",
      "start_ms": 416070,
      "end_ms": 420995,
      "text": "这话我懂就说莫高窟壁画不摸清背景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00163",
      "start_ms": 421350,
      "end_ms": 423445,
      "text": "在您眼里就是一片颜色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00164",
      "start_ms": 423860,
      "end_ms": 428470,
      "text": "都江堰不知道李兵当年怎么把一条江劈成两半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00165",
      "start_ms": 429060,
      "end_ms": 430120,
      "text": "站在鱼嘴上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00166",
      "start_ms": 430360,
      "end_ms": 431395,
      "text": "也就看个热闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00167",
      "start_ms": 431830,
      "end_ms": 435605,
      "text": "悬空寺那几根木梁是怎么挂住的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00168",
      "start_ms": 436370,
      "end_ms": 437595,
      "text": "更没人跟您讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00169",
      "start_ms": 438200,
      "end_ms": 440740,
      "text": "带孙辈出门的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00170",
      "start_ms": 440740,
      "end_ms": 441640,
      "text": "只着问一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00171",
      "start_ms": 441780,
      "end_ms": 443575,
      "text": "这水怎么自己就分了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00172",
      "start_ms": 444030,
      "end_ms": 445455,
      "text": "您要是答不上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00173",
      "start_ms": 445840,
      "end_ms": 446745,
      "text": "脸上就挂不住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00174",
      "start_ms": 447210,
      "end_ms": 450530,
      "text": "前阵子有朋友给我推了本书叫大美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00175",
      "start_ms": 450530,
      "end_ms": 454695,
      "text": "中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00176",
      "start_ms": 455160,
      "end_ms": 459085,
      "text": "说是把全国一百零一个最值得去的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00177",
      "start_ms": 459750,
      "end_ms": 463835,
      "text": "一个一个的攻略来历、门道都理好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00178",
      "start_ms": 464300,
      "end_ms": 465705,
      "text": "还配的实拍的图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00179",
      "start_ms": 466320,
      "end_ms": 467085,
      "text": "翻着不累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00180",
      "start_ms": 467500,
      "end_ms": 469940,
      "text": "出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00181",
      "start_ms": 469940,
      "end_ms": 470765,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00182",
      "start_ms": 471070,
      "end_ms": 472215,
      "text": "知道该往哪看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00183",
      "start_ms": 472850,
      "end_ms": 473995,
      "text": "暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00184",
      "start_ms": 474320,
      "end_ms": 475305,
      "text": "就着慢慢翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00185",
      "start_ms": 475680,
      "end_ms": 477770,
      "text": "也算走过一趟书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00186",
      "start_ms": 477790,
      "end_ms": 482365,
      "text": "我搁在左下方商品里感兴趣的老朋友去瞅一眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00187",
      "start_ms": 482670,
      "end_ms": 484345,
      "text": "好社会正题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00188",
      "start_ms": 484740,
      "end_ms": 485280,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00189",
      "start_ms": 485740,
      "end_ms": 491385,
      "text": "西藏林芝的雅鲁藏布大峡谷和他守着的南迦巴瓦峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00190",
      "start_ms": 492200,
      "end_ms": 493315,
      "text": "为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00191",
      "start_ms": 493780,
      "end_ms": 494755,
      "text": "我先问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00192",
      "start_ms": 495120,
      "end_ms": 496605,
      "text": "整张榜单走到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00193",
      "start_ms": 496960,
      "end_ms": 500105,
      "text": "前面那些一个是人用泥捏的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00194",
      "start_ms": 500470,
      "end_ms": 502485,
      "text": "一个是人拿石头垒的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00195",
      "start_ms": 502780,
      "end_ms": 505185,
      "text": "一个是人把木头插进崖壁的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00196",
      "start_ms": 505860,
      "end_ms": 507125,
      "text": "全是人干的活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00197",
      "start_ms": 507580,
      "end_ms": 510235,
      "text": "您以为第一也该是这么一处老古董，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00198",
      "start_ms": 510580,
      "end_ms": 511705,
      "text": "可偏偏不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00199",
      "start_ms": 512410,
      "end_ms": 514925,
      "text": "它是喜马拉雅东边的一条口子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00200",
      "start_ms": 515530,
      "end_ms": 520335,
      "text": "被雅鲁藏布江从世界屋脊上硬生生劈出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00201",
      "start_ms": 520740,
      "end_ms": 522985,
      "text": "还拐了一个著名的大弯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00202",
      "start_ms": 523390,
      "end_ms": 528240,
      "text": "世界上最深的峡谷最深的地方超过六千米南加，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00203",
      "start_ms": 528240,
      "end_ms": 529480,
      "text": "巴瓦峰立在旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00204",
      "start_ms": 529880,
      "end_ms": 531745,
      "text": "海拔七千七百八十二米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00205",
      "start_ms": 532470,
      "end_ms": 533775,
      "text": "从谷底到封顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00206",
      "start_ms": 534200,
      "end_ms": 535495,
      "text": "落差五千多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00207",
      "start_ms": 535950,
      "end_ms": 536635,
      "text": "什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00208",
      "start_ms": 537260,
      "end_ms": 538855,
      "text": "您从峡谷底往上走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00209",
      "start_ms": 539260,
      "end_ms": 542065,
      "text": "一开始是湿热的原始森林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00210",
      "start_ms": 542850,
      "end_ms": 544335,
      "text": "藤蔓缠在树上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00211",
      "start_ms": 544860,
      "end_ms": 546395,
      "text": "跟西双版纳一个样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00212",
      "start_ms": 547070,
      "end_ms": 549555,
      "text": "再往上是甄叶林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00213",
      "start_ms": 550230,
      "end_ms": 552445,
      "text": "再往上是高山草甸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00214",
      "start_ms": 552940,
      "end_ms": 553775,
      "text": "走到最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00215",
      "start_ms": 554190,
      "end_ms": 559755,
      "text": "是终年不化的血和冰一根柱子上四个世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00216",
      "start_ms": 560420,
      "end_ms": 563415,
      "text": "可这条裂缝平时是不给您看的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00217",
      "start_ms": 563810,
      "end_ms": 566865,
      "text": "南家爸爸一年里大半时间裹在云雾里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00218",
      "start_ms": 567140,
      "end_ms": 569540,
      "text": "当地人管他叫修女峰说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00219",
      "start_ms": 569540,
      "end_ms": 572205,
      "text": "能看见封顶的人是攒的福气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00220",
      "start_ms": 572620,
      "end_ms": 574020,
      "text": "很多人守好几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00221",
      "start_ms": 574340,
      "end_ms": 575835,
      "text": "连一块石头都没看着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00222",
      "start_ms": 576200,
      "end_ms": 576865,
      "text": "就下山了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00223",
      "start_ms": 577710,
      "end_ms": 581545,
      "text": "前面九处有的是老天爷给咱们造的奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00224",
      "start_ms": 582220,
      "end_ms": 584565,
      "text": "有的是老祖宗给咱们留的手艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00225",
      "start_ms": 585000,
      "end_ms": 589945,
      "text": "只有这一处是老天爷再量自己的尺寸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00226",
      "start_ms": 590630,
      "end_ms": 597170,
      "text": "把冰和火把、雪山和雨林全塞进一条五千米深的口子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00227",
      "start_ms": 597650,
      "end_ms": 598430,
      "text": "看完它，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00228",
      "start_ms": 598790,
      "end_ms": 602310,
      "text": "您才知道前面那九个太单薄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00229",
      "start_ms": 602550,
      "end_ms": 603390,
      "text": "太渺小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00230",
      "start_ms": 603810,
      "end_ms": 605070,
      "text": "十个地方说完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00231",
      "start_ms": 605170,
      "end_ms": 606430,
      "text": "您回头细品品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00232",
      "start_ms": 607150,
      "end_ms": 608710,
      "text": "黄山是水墨画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00233",
      "start_ms": 609390,
      "end_ms": 613490,
      "text": "月牙泉是大漠清泉月果树是水声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00234",
      "start_ms": 613490,
      "end_ms": 613910,
      "text": "如雷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00235",
      "start_ms": 614590,
      "end_ms": 616370,
      "text": "张家界是大地骨骼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00236",
      "start_ms": 616950,
      "end_ms": 620205,
      "text": "张马俑是泥土清浑都江堰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00237",
      "start_ms": 620420,
      "end_ms": 621360,
      "text": "这道法自然，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00238",
      "start_ms": 621840,
      "end_ms": 622440,
      "text": "悬空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00239",
      "start_ms": 622480,
      "end_ms": 624120,
      "text": "似是绝壁奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00240",
      "start_ms": 624460,
      "end_ms": 626460,
      "text": "九寨沟是活水生命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00241",
      "start_ms": 627040,
      "end_ms": 629800,
      "text": "莫高窟是一面正在褪色的墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00242",
      "start_ms": 630520,
      "end_ms": 637160,
      "text": "雅鲁藏布大峡谷与南加巴瓦峰是看一眼就让人闭上嘴巴的终极尺度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00243",
      "start_ms": 637540,
      "end_ms": 639380,
      "text": "这十处壮丽奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00244",
      "start_ms": 639740,
      "end_ms": 640940,
      "text": "趁要紧的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00245",
      "start_ms": 640960,
      "end_ms": 642140,
      "text": "他们都不等人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00246",
      "start_ms": 642620,
      "end_ms": 645660,
      "text": "壁画在一寸寸风化雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00247",
      "start_ms": 645660,
      "end_ms": 647160,
      "text": "在一年年变样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00248",
      "start_ms": 647420,
      "end_ms": 648780,
      "text": "趁腿脚还利索，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00249",
      "start_ms": 649080,
      "end_ms": 650275,
      "text": "趁眼里还有光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00250",
      "start_ms": 650690,
      "end_ms": 652205,
      "text": "别光顾着收藏了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00251",
      "start_ms": 652590,
      "end_ms": 657430,
      "text": "出发前想把门道摸透的那本大美中国的链接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00252",
      "start_ms": 657750,
      "end_ms": 661955,
      "text": "就在左下角觉得这期内容给您提了提气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00253",
      "start_ms": 662490,
      "end_ms": 663910,
      "text": "劳烦转给身边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00254",
      "start_ms": 664070,
      "end_ms": 666085,
      "text": "想一块出门看看的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00255",
      "start_ms": 666540,
      "end_ms": 668995,
      "text": "想听更多中华大地的好故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00256",
      "start_ms": 669260,
      "end_ms": 669955,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7fa3a84d41edebb9_s00257",
      "start_ms": 670280,
      "end_ms": 671755,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
